---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About — Disciple's Creed"
	description="The story behind Disciple's Creed and the person leading it."
>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center sm:py-28">
		<h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-medium text-parchment sm:text-5xl">Our Story</h1>
		<p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
			Disciple's Creed started with a simple conviction: following Jesus well means learning to
			help others follow him too. Everything here — every training, every page — exists to make
			that easier.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="border-t border-gold-deep/20 bg-surface/40 px-6 py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
			<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-parchment sm:text-3xl">Meet the Founder</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-gold">[Founder Name]</p>
			<p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
				[Add the founder's bio here — background, calling, and how this ministry started. A
				paragraph or two is plenty.]
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
